# Posts written from the browser Add/Edit page are created through GitHub's
# API with Unix (LF) line endings, while editing or saving them on Windows
# can rewrite them with CRLF. Without this, every push carried phantom
# "changes" to posts nobody had actually edited, hiding the real ones.
# Normalise everything to LF in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Batch files are the exception -- Windows needs CRLF for these to run.
*.bat text eol=crlf
